` appear on stdout.\n4. Build Godot editor with `builtin_icu4c=no`, and run the project.\n5. Scene crashed with signal 11 when trying to output `print`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/j20001970/godot_builtin_icu4c_stdout_crash","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100301/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}